      "prueba_propuesta": "from datetime import date, timedelta\nfrom twlab.evaluation import WeeklyObservation, block_bootstrap_mean\n\ndef test_exact_segment_weight():\n    days = [date(2024,1,1) + timedelta(weeks=i) for i in (0,2,3,4,5)]\n    rows = [WeeklyObservation(f'{d.isocalendar().year}-W{d.isocalendar().week:02}', str(i), 'historical_numeric_temporally_controlled', None, True, float(i == 0)) for i,d in enumerate(days)]\n    result = block_bootstrap_mean(rows, block_length=4, n_boot=100000, seed=1)\n    assert abs(result.resample_mean - 0.2) < 0.003\n\n# Corregir la regla de parada/ponderación y regenerar los intervalos; las tolerancias originales ocultaban este residuo.",
